{title: Ha Khel Savalyancha}
{artist: Hridaynath Mangeshkar}
{key: C}

{c: Verse 1}
[C]Raatrich [Am]khel [G]chhale
[C]Ya [Am]god [G]chandnyancha
[D]Sampel [G]na kadihi
[G]Ha [Am]khel [C]savlyancha
[C]Ha [Am]khel [G]savlayancha
[D]Ha [G]khel savlyancha
[C]Ha [G]chandra [Em]na swayambhu
[Em]Ravi [C]tej [F]Wahatoh Haa
[F]Grahnat [D]Chandnyancha
[F]Abhishaap [D]bhogtoh [G]haan
[C]Prretit [Am]mand hoi
[Am]Ha [G]goodh chandnyancha
[C]Ha [Am]khel [G]savlyancha
[D]Ha [G]khel savlyancha
